  "body": "Tender: Closes on Tuesday 17 November 2026 at 2:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nSeamless indoor-outdoor flow leads to a sun-drenched deck and easy-care landscaped gardens - perfect for BBQs and gatherings. Flat 370m² section with an approximately 244m² home.\r\n\r\nTwo expansive family rooms offer multiple zones for relaxation and entertaining, while open-plan living areas are designed for comfort and connection. The modern designer kitchen features ample pantry space - ideal for family meals and entertaining. Four generous double bedrooms plus a large rumpus (use it as an extra living room, study, or bedroom—your choice) provide plenty of room for the whole family, complemented by 3.5 beautifully appointed bathrooms, including two luxurious master ensuites, one on each level.\r\n\r\nThe versatile layout suits a range of family needs - ideal for working from home, extended family, teenagers, or home-stays.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned between Silverdale Shopping Centre, beautiful beaches, and surrounding amenities. Enjoy easy motorway access and a short drive to Silverdale/Millwater, Orewa town centre, and Albany. The property is also zoned for high-decile schools.\r\n\r\nThis is a fantastic family home — ready to move in and enjoy the generous spaces, solid construction, and private garden, caters to various needs.",
